WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.300
"My Rival and Me"

3
00:32.300 --> 00:34.300
(Episode 7)

4
01:09.200 --> 01:14.813
I've really done it now. Did I magically turn a straight guy gay?

5
01:18.760 --> 01:20.480
You just gave me a little kiss,

6
01:20.560 --> 01:21.640
then fell straight asleep,

7
01:21.719 --> 01:23.599
leaving me here awake all night.

8
01:32.519 --> 01:36.239
I secretly shipped us so hard that I turned myself gay,

9
01:36.319 --> 01:38.920
then basked in his kindness and affection

10
01:38.959 --> 01:41.959
and dragged him into this too.

11
01:52.560 --> 01:54.885
Oh, Gu Yiliang.

12
01:54.910 --> 01:58.845
When you wake up, how am I supposed to face you?

13
02:09.840 --> 02:11.120
Get some rest.

14
02:11.400 --> 02:13.400
You have a big scene tomorrow.

15
02:53.463 --> 02:55.630
[Good morning, do your best the whole day!]

16
03:07.303 --> 03:09.096
[Today's outfit was hand-selected by Master Wei]

17
03:29.396 --> 03:31.129
[Today's breakfast was prepared by Chef Wei, Bon Appetit]

18
03:37.719 --> 03:41.280
Is he always this attentive to his sugar daddies?

19
03:49.479 --> 03:50.639
Look at that bird.

20
03:51.319 --> 03:52.439
A real bird! [It isn't]

21
03:54.960 --> 03:56.120
And that fish.

22
03:56.439 --> 03:57.439
A real fish! [It's not]

23
03:57.719 --> 04:01.080
Niangzi is real! Niangzi is real!

24
04:01.159 --> 04:02.199
Niangzi!

25
04:02.520 --> 04:03.520
And that bell.

26
04:04.919 --> 04:05.919
A real bell!

27
04:06.400 --> 04:07.400
Niangzi!

28
04:07.560 --> 04:09.560
How long has your boss been like this?

29
04:09.840 --> 04:10.840
Years.

30
04:11.159 --> 04:12.599
Yanyan has a big scene today.

31
04:12.719 --> 04:14.159
That means at least ten takes.

32
04:14.479 --> 04:16.519
We'll all be here all night again.

33
04:16.879 --> 04:19.079
Better order coffee for the whole crew.

34
04:20.639 --> 04:21.279
To drink?

35
04:21.600 --> 04:22.600
The usual.

36
04:22.839 --> 04:23.839
An Americano.

37
04:25.399 --> 04:26.839
Extra strong.

38
04:39.399 --> 04:41.759
Thank you for looking after me all this time.

39
04:42.040 --> 04:44.160
But time waits for no one.

40
04:45.000 --> 04:46.000
Safe travels.

41
04:46.720 --> 04:48.160
We met by chance,

42
04:48.639 --> 04:51.519
without even knowing each other's true names.

43
04:51.959 --> 04:53.079
Yet our paths have crossed,

44
04:53.600 --> 04:54.839
and I hope they will again.

45
05:04.319 --> 05:05.319
No need to see me out.

46
05:05.360 --> 05:06.480
My carriage is just outside.

47
05:07.240 --> 05:08.240
Farewell.

48
05:08.759 --> 05:09.759
Wait.

49
05:14.480 --> 05:16.199
There's something else I want to say.

50
05:25.720 --> 05:27.240
May all your wishes come true,

51
05:28.680 --> 05:29.800
May you live free of sorrow.

52
05:33.920 --> 05:34.920
Cut!

53
05:45.319 --> 05:46.319
That's a take!

54
05:47.120 --> 05:48.120
One take!

55
05:48.639 --> 05:50.480
We won't be here all night!

56
05:57.360 --> 05:58.360
Hey, hey.

57
05:58.600 --> 05:59.879
Mr. Wei, wake up!

58
06:00.040 --> 06:01.040
You did great.

59
06:03.040 --> 06:03.560
We got it?

60
06:03.680 --> 06:04.079
We did.

61
06:04.199 --> 06:04.759
Really?

62
06:04.800 --> 06:05.800
Yes.

63
06:07.800 --> 06:09.439
Wei, you were really on form.

64
06:09.639 --> 06:11.040
I told you, you're a quick learner.

65
06:11.079 --> 06:14.000
Such progress! Such emotion! You outdid yourself.

66
06:18.399 --> 06:19.399
Director.

67
06:19.439 --> 06:21.920
Did Mr. Huang invest more money in the show again?

68
06:22.680 --> 06:23.519
Don't be ridiculous.

69
06:23.560 --> 06:25.319
No. Well, not much.

70
06:25.360 --> 06:25.879
What?

71
06:26.000 --> 06:27.079
No, I mean...

72
06:27.199 --> 06:29.759
You put so much feeling into that.

73
06:29.800 --> 06:32.680
Is there a girl you've fallen for?

74
06:32.680 --> 06:33.720
No, Gu Yi... [It sounds like "It wasn't intentional"]

75
06:35.936 --> 06:37.536
I never meant

76
06:37.560 --> 06:40.800
to lose myself along the way.

77
06:41.000 --> 06:42.639
For you,

78
06:42.879 --> 06:47.000
I try so hard to be perfect.

79
06:47.959 --> 06:48.959
You sing well too.

80
06:49.439 --> 06:50.839
Thank you, Director. Thank you.

81
06:54.399 --> 06:55.720
Good thing I'm quick on my feet,

82
06:55.800 --> 06:57.279
and musically gifted.

83
07:04.680 --> 07:06.040
I heard you got it in one take.

84
07:07.160 --> 07:08.480
You've really improved.

85
07:10.800 --> 07:11.800
You're too kind.

86
07:12.040 --> 07:13.399
I had a great teacher.

87
07:23.240 --> 07:23.879
My phone.

88
07:23.959 --> 07:25.360
Where's my phone?

89
07:25.839 --> 07:26.839
I'll find my phone.

90
07:26.920 --> 07:27.920
I'll let you get on.

91
07:28.000 --> 07:29.240
See you.

92
07:29.759 --> 07:30.480
Chen!

93
07:30.560 --> 07:32.040
Where has that little brat gone?

94
07:32.160 --> 07:33.160
Chen!

95
07:37.920 --> 07:39.839
Where's my phone?

96
07:46.519 --> 07:47.519
Hello?

97
07:47.720 --> 07:48.720
What?

98
07:49.399 --> 07:51.360
Oh, my dear Mr. Huang.

99
07:51.360 --> 07:53.680
Stop secretly funding my production.

100
07:54.199 --> 07:55.240
Stop sending me money too.

101
07:57.839 --> 07:59.120
You just won't listen, will you?

102
08:04.199 --> 08:05.199
Mr. Gu.

103
08:07.560 --> 08:08.560
Looking for our Yanyan?

104
08:09.879 --> 08:10.319
No.

105
08:10.879 --> 08:11.279
Passing.

106
08:11.319 --> 08:13.800
Stop, stop. Enough. Bye-bye.

107
08:50.080 --> 08:51.679
Why is your face so red?

108
08:52.320 --> 08:53.320
I...

109
08:53.440 --> 08:54.480
Are you feeling unwell?

110
08:54.559 --> 08:55.360
No.

111
08:55.519 --> 08:57.000
I'm hot. Just hot.

112
08:58.279 --> 09:00.200
Director Lu wants a crew dinner tonight.

113
09:00.279 --> 09:01.279
Oh, okay.

114
09:01.519 --> 09:03.840
Okay, I admit it. I'm done for.

115
09:03.919 --> 09:06.480
Looks like I've really fallen for someone.

116
09:06.559 --> 09:09.200
Gu Yiliang.

117
09:09.799 --> 09:12.200
Here's to a smooth shoot for Lan Jue!

118
09:12.840 --> 09:13.840
Cheers!

119
09:13.960 --> 09:15.919
Cheers!

120
09:18.080 --> 09:20.440
Sit down, everyone. Eat while it's hot.

121
09:22.679 --> 09:23.679
Help yourselves.

122
09:25.960 --> 09:26.960
Director Lu's treat?

123
09:27.120 --> 09:28.399
At a place like this?

124
09:28.440 --> 09:29.440
How generous.

125
09:29.879 --> 09:31.759
Director Lu said you're treating us.

126
09:32.159 --> 09:33.159
I am?

127
09:36.080 --> 09:38.240
Oh, right. It's on me.

128
09:38.360 --> 09:40.720
What a lavish feast.

129
09:40.799 --> 09:42.159
How much did Huang spend on this?

130
09:42.240 --> 09:43.280
I'll eat my money's worth.

131
09:57.840 --> 09:58.960
Why aren't you eating?

132
10:01.120 --> 10:02.120
What's wrong?

133
10:02.320 --> 10:03.039
Nothing.

134
10:03.240 --> 10:04.240
Go ahead.

135
10:27.840 --> 10:28.840
Yanzi.

136
10:29.919 --> 10:32.080
Got any leads on our next show?

137
10:32.200 --> 10:33.960
Not at the moment.

138
10:34.519 --> 10:35.200
Why?

139
10:35.320 --> 10:37.320
Nothing. I was just thinking.

140
10:37.399 --> 10:39.840
Everything's gone so smoothly for you.

141
10:40.240 --> 10:41.240
We're not so lucky.

142
10:41.320 --> 10:43.360
We have no connections,

143
10:43.440 --> 10:46.039
so we have to work our way up ourselves.

144
10:47.000 --> 10:47.679
So,

145
10:47.759 --> 10:49.440
I wanted to ask your advice.

146
10:49.559 --> 10:52.279
How did you learn to work such miracles?

147
10:53.519 --> 10:55.600
It's all down to fate.

148
10:55.919 --> 10:58.000
I suggest a visit to Nanpu Temple.

149
10:58.120 --> 10:59.480
Praying there really works.

150
11:00.519 --> 11:01.519
Yanzi, wait!

151
11:02.120 --> 11:03.159
I'll be sure to go.

152
11:03.320 --> 11:05.039
But first, let me toast you again.

153
11:05.320 --> 11:06.639
May your good luck

154
11:06.759 --> 11:08.480
last forever.

155
11:11.519 --> 11:12.519
You don't have to drink.

156
11:13.799 --> 11:14.799
I'll drink with you.

157
11:16.720 --> 11:17.840
Thank you, sir.

158
11:18.440 --> 11:19.720
Why are you drinking?

159
11:19.799 --> 11:22.080
You drink worse than I act.

160
11:22.159 --> 11:22.799
Sir.

161
11:22.960 --> 11:25.200
I really admire true talent like yours.

162
11:25.679 --> 11:26.360
Some people

163
11:26.399 --> 11:27.440
may climb high,

164
11:27.960 --> 11:29.440
but whether it's luck behind them

165
11:29.440 --> 11:30.679
or something else...

166
11:31.080 --> 11:32.320
Who can say?

167
11:33.200 --> 11:34.720
Enough of the chatter.

168
11:35.120 --> 11:36.360
If you admire me, drink up.

169
11:37.200 --> 11:37.720
Drink.

170
11:37.759 --> 11:38.759
Come on.

171
11:41.639 --> 11:42.039
Sir.

172
11:42.080 --> 11:42.600
I'll go.

173
11:42.720 --> 11:43.720
Come back.

174
11:44.240 --> 11:45.279
Has no one taught you

175
11:45.320 --> 11:47.679
how to clink glasses with your seniors?

176
11:49.960 --> 11:50.960
Sorry. I'm sorry.

177
11:51.399 --> 11:52.399
An apology drink.

178
11:52.639 --> 11:53.840
Finish that one first.

179
11:55.360 --> 11:56.840
Yes. Bottoms up.

180
12:00.159 --> 12:01.639
Finished. Now another.

181
12:04.000 --> 12:05.200
Go easy.

182
12:07.320 --> 12:09.320
Sir, it was my fault.

183
12:16.759 --> 12:17.480
Bottoms up!

184
12:17.600 --> 12:18.600
But, sir...

185
12:18.799 --> 12:19.799
Keep going.

186
12:20.039 --> 12:21.039
Drink, drink, drink.

187
12:30.960 --> 12:31.480
Come on.

188
12:31.759 --> 12:32.759
Drink.

189
12:33.039 --> 12:34.039
That's enough.

190
12:34.960 --> 12:36.080
We're all getting drunk!

191
12:36.120 --> 12:37.120
Come on.

192
12:42.440 --> 12:44.000
You can really hold your liquor.

193
12:47.679 --> 12:48.399
Keep drinking.

194
12:48.519 --> 12:49.559
Drink.

195
12:50.759 --> 12:51.720
Why drink so much?

196
12:51.720 --> 12:52.840
What are you on about?

197
13:01.320 --> 13:02.879
I'm going to the restroom.

198
13:08.840 --> 13:10.039
Don't go, sir.

199
13:10.320 --> 13:11.320
Let's keep going!

200
13:12.080 --> 13:13.080
Go check on him.

201
13:29.399 --> 13:30.399
Yanyan.

202
13:35.080 --> 13:36.159
Sorry. I'm sorry.

203
13:36.320 --> 13:37.120
It's okay.

204
13:37.186 --> 13:38.186
Yanyan?

205
13:39.200 --> 13:40.200
Don't you remember me?

206
13:40.360 --> 13:41.879
Oh, Uncle Qi, right?

207
13:42.200 --> 13:43.440
Sorry. I didn't recognize you.

208
13:43.519 --> 13:45.679
Why didn't you say you were filming here?

209
13:45.720 --> 13:47.200
I could look after you for Huang.

210
13:52.960 --> 13:54.440
Uncle Qi, this is my friend.

211
13:54.480 --> 13:57.159
Our crew's having dinner here together.

212
13:58.559 --> 13:59.559
Friend?

213
14:00.960 --> 14:02.320
What's with this veteran actor?

214
14:02.399 --> 14:03.919
He's been spoiling for a fight.

215
14:04.360 --> 14:05.039
Yanyan.

216
14:05.120 --> 14:05.720
Yes?

217
14:05.919 --> 14:06.919
I don't feel well.

218
14:07.919 --> 14:08.919
Take me back.

219
14:11.440 --> 14:12.440
Uncle Qi,

220
14:12.519 --> 14:13.519
I'm sorry,

221
14:13.559 --> 14:15.080
but I have to go.

222
14:15.279 --> 14:16.320
I'll visit another time.

223
14:16.879 --> 14:17.960
Come on. Let's go.

224
14:18.279 --> 14:20.120
How much did you drink?

225
14:25.759 --> 14:27.000
Lucas.

226
14:27.120 --> 14:30.039
Have you seen our big guy, Gu?

227
14:30.159 --> 14:30.879
No.

228
14:30.919 --> 14:32.360
Where's our Yanyan?

229
14:39.840 --> 14:40.840
Yanyan!

230
14:41.080 --> 14:42.159
Where did you go?

231
14:42.360 --> 14:43.799
I was so worried about you.

232
14:45.039 --> 14:46.519
You're such a phony.

233
14:47.600 --> 14:48.600
Gu!

234
14:48.639 --> 14:50.919
I'm the one who's worried about you!

235
14:51.360 --> 14:52.360
I...

236
14:54.960 --> 14:57.360
How will everyone get home in this state?

237
14:57.759 --> 14:58.960
Go with him.

238
14:59.679 --> 15:00.679
Chen Youyuan!

239
15:00.919 --> 15:02.039
Chen Youyuan, get up!

240
15:02.240 --> 15:03.240
Chen Youyuan!

241
15:06.240 --> 15:07.360
Love is a cup of wine.

242
15:07.399 --> 15:08.960
It gets everyone drunk.

243
15:11.879 --> 15:13.360
Mingming, could you call me

244
15:13.799 --> 15:14.799
a cab?

245
15:16.799 --> 15:18.120
Never mind. I'll call one myself.

246
15:32.799 --> 15:34.639
The buses must have stopped by now.

247
15:35.639 --> 15:36.759
I'll splurge tonight.

248
15:37.000 --> 15:38.000
I'll get a cab.

249
15:41.600 --> 15:42.600
Cancel it. Cancel!

250
15:42.679 --> 15:43.559
Too expensive.

251
15:43.639 --> 15:44.639
Forget it.

252
15:45.639 --> 15:46.639
Mingming.

253
15:48.960 --> 15:49.960
Why are you here?

254
15:50.279 --> 15:51.279
Picking you up.

255
15:52.399 --> 15:54.639
Haven't you been really busy lately?

256
15:55.440 --> 15:56.720
I have time to pick you up.

257
16:02.159 --> 16:03.159
Here.

258
16:05.120 --> 16:06.120
What's this?

259
16:06.159 --> 16:07.159
Soup to sober you up.

260
16:08.720 --> 16:11.279
Soup to sober me up?

261
16:21.360 --> 16:22.559
How can you be so clumsy?

262
16:24.840 --> 16:25.879
Thank goodness.

263
16:26.080 --> 16:27.159
You're okay.

264
16:46.919 --> 16:47.919
It stopped hurting.

265
16:48.440 --> 16:49.440
Let's go home.

266
17:48.200 --> 17:49.119
What are you doing?

267
17:49.160 --> 17:50.279
Taking my clothes off.

268
17:52.759 --> 17:54.599
Want to make the news? Behave yourself!

269
17:54.720 --> 17:56.920
We're home. Shouldn't I get undressed?

270
17:57.240 --> 17:59.599
No! What are you doing?

271
17:59.640 --> 18:01.279
Are we going or not?

272
18:01.319 --> 18:02.400
Yes, please, let's go.

273
18:03.480 --> 18:04.920
I can't hold him back much longer.

274
18:06.079 --> 18:07.079
Keep them on!

275
18:10.000 --> 18:11.000
Why aren't we moving?

276
18:11.119 --> 18:12.519
Last four digits of your number?

277
18:12.839 --> 18:14.039
8602.

278
18:28.319 --> 18:30.680
Stop rubbing against me!

279
18:30.759 --> 18:32.920
Please behave.

280
18:33.079 --> 18:34.799
We're almost home. Be good.

281
18:36.240 --> 18:36.880
Okay.

282
18:37.200 --> 18:38.240
Whatever you say.

283
18:40.039 --> 18:43.240
But I'm not the only one in your heart.

284
18:58.200 --> 18:59.559
Don't throw up! Not in his car!

285
18:59.559 --> 19:00.640
Don't throw up. Hold it in.

286
19:00.640 --> 19:01.640
Hold it in.

287
19:29.680 --> 19:33.240
Why is that dog Cheng so good tonight?

288
19:42.000 --> 19:43.640
Go to sleep. Good night.

289
19:50.279 --> 19:52.119
Does Cheng Yan have a split personality?

290
19:52.200 --> 19:55.279
Or have I lost my appeal?

291
20:09.759 --> 20:12.480
I knew he couldn't hold out.

292
20:15.640 --> 20:16.640
Good night.

293
20:22.400 --> 20:23.400
Cheng Yan.

294
20:23.440 --> 20:24.440
You want someone else?

295
20:25.200 --> 20:26.200
What?

296
20:28.279 --> 20:29.680
While this contract is in force,

297
20:29.880 --> 20:32.559
Party B must provide services to Party A.

298
20:32.720 --> 20:33.720
Boss.

299
20:33.799 --> 20:36.000
I'm going to insist on serving you now.

300
20:45.200 --> 20:46.400
What are you laughing at?

301
20:47.200 --> 20:48.200
What do you mean?

302
20:48.240 --> 20:49.240
Tell me.

303
20:49.839 --> 20:51.319
You've just left the hospital.

304
20:51.920 --> 20:53.200
No strenuous exercise.

305
20:54.200 --> 20:55.200
No rush.

306
20:55.319 --> 20:56.480
We've got years ahead of us.

307
20:56.839 --> 20:57.839
Take it slow.

308
21:01.759 --> 21:02.759
Be good.

309
21:08.279 --> 21:09.279
Cover up.

310
21:12.079 --> 21:13.079
There.

311
21:13.119 --> 21:14.119
Good night.

312
21:18.039 --> 21:19.759
What does he mean?

313
21:19.839 --> 21:23.039
He still wants to do it decades from now?

314
21:24.240 --> 21:25.319
In his dreams.

315
21:44.400 --> 21:45.400
Stand still.

316
21:50.480 --> 21:51.480
Stand still.

317
21:54.799 --> 21:55.839
Your key card?

318
21:56.559 --> 21:57.880
Where's your key card?

319
22:01.759 --> 22:02.839
Someone help me.

320
22:02.920 --> 22:05.440
How is he more seductive drunk than sober?

321
22:05.440 --> 22:08.559
Stop it. Any more and I'll turn to ash.

322
22:33.359 --> 22:34.359
Get some sleep.

323
22:34.559 --> 22:35.599
I'm leaving.

324
22:37.160 --> 22:38.759
I want a shower.

325
22:40.079 --> 22:41.079
You shouldn't.

326
22:41.319 --> 22:43.480
You might slip and fall.

327
22:44.640 --> 22:48.559
I want a shower.

328
22:51.480 --> 22:53.720
This is so annoying.

329
23:02.279 --> 23:03.279
A shower.

330
23:18.359 --> 23:20.279
Should I leave?

331
23:26.680 --> 23:28.240
In a place like this, with this mood...

332
23:29.039 --> 23:31.200
How can sober me save drunken him?

333
23:31.759 --> 23:33.039
What if I can't hold back

334
23:33.039 --> 23:34.640
and end up crossing swords with him?

335
23:50.440 --> 23:52.039
I'm drunk.

336
23:52.200 --> 23:53.400
The floor's so slippery.

337
23:53.599 --> 23:55.400
Somehow I tripped

338
23:56.000 --> 23:57.960
and fell into your arms.

339
24:04.000 --> 24:05.000
Forget it.

340
24:05.160 --> 24:07.279
Don't force it if you can't act.

341
24:07.640 --> 24:08.960
What am I supposed to do now?

342
24:09.039 --> 24:10.599
The fanfics never taught me this.

343
24:11.839 --> 24:12.839
Fanfics.

344
24:13.440 --> 24:14.440
The fanfics!

345
24:28.440 --> 24:29.680
Why is it that in every fanfic,

346
24:30.039 --> 24:32.200
Gu Yiliang can hold his liquor,

347
24:32.599 --> 24:34.000
while I'm the one who's wasted?

348
24:34.039 --> 24:35.599
This world is anything but straight.

349
24:35.680 --> 24:36.960
This gay, purple-tinted world...

350
24:37.039 --> 24:38.720
I've seen through it all.

351
24:40.960 --> 24:41.960
Gu Yiliang.

352
24:42.400 --> 24:43.400
Gu Yiliang!

353
24:43.440 --> 24:45.240
Gu Yiliang, did you hit something?

354
24:45.359 --> 24:48.519
I'm too tall. I hit the showerhead.

355
24:49.759 --> 24:51.319
Be careful!

356
24:56.319 --> 24:58.519
I want to misbehave. No, be civilized.

357
24:59.000 --> 25:00.000
Take your pants off.

358
25:00.200 --> 25:01.200
Hm?

359
25:01.960 --> 25:03.160
I'm such a top.

360
25:03.240 --> 25:05.319
I never thought I'd say that to Gu Yiliang.

361
25:17.039 --> 25:18.039
What are you doing?

362
25:19.400 --> 25:20.400
Stop rubbing on me.

363
25:20.880 --> 25:22.039
Stop rubbing on me.

364
25:23.119 --> 25:24.119
Stop rubbing on me.

365
25:25.559 --> 25:26.559
Ah!

366
25:28.920 --> 25:29.920
Is that okay?

367
25:32.920 --> 25:33.920
Yes.

368
25:34.759 --> 25:36.400
Yes, yes, yes.

369
25:41.359 --> 25:43.200
This is terrifying.

370
25:44.000 --> 25:45.000
I take my leave.

371
25:46.480 --> 25:47.599
No, no.

372
25:48.559 --> 25:50.519
This is too terrifying.

373
25:54.200 --> 25:55.200
Yanyan.

374
25:57.279 --> 25:58.440
What did you call me?

375
25:59.519 --> 26:00.519
Wei.

376
26:01.440 --> 26:02.680
You know who I am?

377
26:03.000 --> 26:04.559
Why wouldn't I?

378
26:04.640 --> 26:07.240
I'm drunk, not stupid.

379
26:18.119 --> 26:19.599
Can I kiss you?

380
26:22.079 --> 26:24.279
Let me turn to ash, then.

381
26:24.359 --> 26:27.079
I can't wait forever. I'll seize the day.

382
27:20.039 --> 27:21.039
What's wrong?

383
27:21.519 --> 27:22.519
Are you uncomfortable?

384
27:23.119 --> 27:25.759
I want you to enjoy this too.

385
27:38.759 --> 27:39.920
Don't force yourself.

386
27:40.720 --> 27:41.799
I'm not forcing myself.

387
27:50.960 --> 27:51.960
Gu Yiliang.

388
27:53.119 --> 27:54.599
Gu Yiliang, stop!

389
27:55.039 --> 27:56.039
Ah!

390
28:06.359 --> 28:07.519
Are you okay?

391
28:11.240 --> 28:12.240
Does it hurt much?

392
28:12.359 --> 28:13.559
Stop patting it.

393
28:13.960 --> 28:15.400
It's not a TV

394
28:15.720 --> 28:17.279
you can fix by hitting it.

395
28:18.200 --> 28:19.200
Then I'll

396
28:19.880 --> 28:20.880
practice some more.

397
28:22.960 --> 28:24.599
On me?

398
28:25.880 --> 28:28.359
Who else would I practice on?

399
28:29.720 --> 28:30.839
Go ahead.

400
28:31.640 --> 28:33.359
Practice all you want.

401
28:38.000 --> 28:40.559
However you like.

402
28:41.519 --> 28:42.519
I'm sorry.

403
28:43.000 --> 28:44.880
It's my first time doing this for someone.

404
28:45.680 --> 28:47.440
My fault. I was too rough.

405
28:48.119 --> 28:49.160
What's my name?

406
28:49.759 --> 28:50.759
Wei Yanzi.

407
28:50.960 --> 28:51.960
What's my name?

408
28:52.680 --> 28:53.680
Yanyan.

409
29:15.989 --> 29:17.876
[Bonus Content: Gu Yiliang's Diary 3]

410
29:18.920 --> 29:19.960
Douya.

411
29:21.359 --> 29:23.839
I've devoured my rival,

412
29:24.759 --> 29:26.160
and skipped out on the bill.

413
29:26.920 --> 29:29.920
I feel so guilty,

414
29:31.640 --> 29:33.200
but that very guilt

415
29:34.000 --> 29:35.599
makes me happy.

416
29:38.319 --> 29:39.319
I know

417
29:39.680 --> 29:41.119
it wasn't the alcohol.

418
29:41.759 --> 29:43.799
It was bound to happen.

419
29:45.240 --> 29:47.920
I just regret that I gave him nothing

420
29:48.160 --> 29:49.160
before making him...

421
29:52.720 --> 29:54.359
If I can't even be a good sugar daddy,

422
29:54.480 --> 29:56.400
how can I be a good boyfriend?

423
29:59.920 --> 30:01.359
I don't want to be his sugar daddy.

424
30:03.720 --> 30:04.720
I want to win his heart.

425
30:06.079 --> 30:07.079
Douya.

426
30:07.160 --> 30:08.759
Any advice for me?

427
30:09.359 --> 30:13.359
I'll give you the most direct, straightforward advice.

428
30:13.680 --> 30:15.920
I suggest your rival call the police.

429
30:21.480 --> 30:23.279
So artificial intelligence

430
30:24.039 --> 30:26.079
has learned to be jealous.

431
30:27.480 --> 30:28.559
But that's okay.

432
30:29.079 --> 30:30.559
I'll take it step by step.

433
30:31.160 --> 30:32.160
First,

434
30:32.559 --> 30:34.640
I need to improve my technique.

435
30:36.279 --> 30:37.839
As for Mr. Huang,

436
30:39.079 --> 30:40.480
I'll make him understand

437
30:41.559 --> 30:43.519
that Yanyan belongs to me alone.

438
30:46.079 --> 30:47.079
Got to go.

439
30:48.119 --> 30:49.119
My boyfriend...

440
30:50.000 --> 30:51.000
Oh,

441
30:51.519 --> 30:52.519
my rival

442
30:52.759 --> 30:53.759
is waiting for me.
